<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 585 0 R
/E (Asasales representative at TheChaiShop&Co, I want to efficiently manage customer relationships and streamline sales processes using our CRM application. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
688 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 585 0 R
/E (I want to easily access and update employer details, as well as distinguish between online and offline customer records using record types, allowing for personalized interactions. Additionally, I need the application to automate sales calculations, such as order quantity and total bill amount, to ensure accurate and efficient transactions. Moreover, I require the ability to generate insightful reports and dashboards to summarize and analyze sales data effectively, aiding in decision-making and strategy development. Lastly, I would like the application to automate email notifications to customers on their birthdays, informing them of special offers tailored to celebrate their special day, enhancing customer engagement and loyalty. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
